  "description": "Given an m x n matrix, return an array of all the elements of the matrix in a diagonal order.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1. m = matrix.length, n = matrix[0].length\n2. res = [], i = 0, j = 0, up = true\n3. while res.length < m * n:\n4.   res.push(matrix[i][j])\n5.   if up:\n6.     if j == n - 1: i++, up = false\n7.     else if i == 0: j++, up = false\n8.     else: i--, j++\n9.   else:\n10.    if i == m - 1: j++, up = true\n11.    else if j == 0: i++, up = true\n12.    else: i++, j--",
